{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54635","headline":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天阴久，不雨数朝期。\n忽有雷鸣我军上，前程得捷便占（辛本、川本作「占便」）宜，反此我军危。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}